@startuml offering-agentic-realization-boundary
title Offering / Agentic Offering Realization Boundary ; per ADR-ES-018 §1 + §2 + §3

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

class "Offering" as O
class "Agentic Offering" as AO
class "Material Agentic Realization" as MAR

O <|-- AO : specializes
AO *-- MAR : material-evidence

class "Stakeholder Intent Interpretation" as SII
class "Contextual Evaluation" as CE
class "Dynamic Composition" as DC
class "Dynamic Configuration" as DCF
class "Action Selection" as AS
class "Coordination" as Coord
class "Adaptation" as Adp
class "Exception Interpretation" as EI
class "Bounded Decision-Making" as BDM

MAR --> SII
MAR --> CE
MAR --> DC
MAR --> DCF
MAR --> AS
MAR --> Coord
MAR --> Adp
MAR --> EI
MAR --> BDM

note bottom of MAR
  Material agentic realization requires substantive evidence
  in one or more of the listed dimensions per ADR-ES-018 §5.
end note

@enduml
